UPDATE posts SET content = $tag6$<p>Doodle art are the names given to the drawings that the person usually draws without raising his hand. Also known as simple doodles. People often make doodles while their heads are intense and thinking about other things. In this way, beautiful works of art can come out. Although doodle art is a work that people do when their heads are intense, photos and videos have recently been made to make these drawings easier to be made by other people. </p>



<p>These works, created with the imagination of the content producers, are conveyed to the audience in simple steps and allow them to gain practice. To make doodle drawings, all you need is a pen and paper (napkin, book page, even your hand). </p>



<p>The word doodle was first used in the 17th century to mean stupid or stupid. It may be derived from German Dudeltopf or Dudeldop. The meaning of the word later changed to stupid drawings. The main reason for this is the 1936 film Mr. In the final trial scene of Deeds Goes to Town, the main character says "scribble" the word "people draw the stupidest pictures while thinking"[1].</p>



<h2>Simple Doodle Art Ideas</h2>



<p>Doodle drawings are mostly used in bullet journal designs today. But if you choose your pen according to which float you will use the design for, you can get permanent and beautiful designs. Doodles used in bullet journal design can be in different ways. For example, you can make a Christmas tree with a simple doodle drawing in the theme to be used for the month of December. On the other hand, you can decorate your pages with drawings of hearts, stars, flowers or animals.</p>



